      <activity id="efbaff8f-b103-544a-a087-3dcba5ba7527" activityNameId="d579a46f-7ae4-5925-acd8-75d23ab3f9fe" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Trichloroborane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Trichloroborane, at plant
The process "trichloroborane, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  trichloroborane from boron carbide and chlorine in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 010294-34-5; 
Formula: BCl3; 
Synonyms: boron trichloride, boron chloride; 
UUID: 4485d0dd-00ef-31e0-b19f-04cd601be66f
Production of trichloroborane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chlorinatio0n of boron carbide
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4485d0dd-00ef-31e0-b19f-04cd601be66f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
